Aye Momino Yasrab Me Ajab Nauha Gari Hai<br>
Zehra Ke Liye Daaghe Ghame Be Pidari Hai<br>
Lab Khushk Hai Muh Zard Hai Aankhou Me Tari Hai<br>
Paighambare Kounain Chiraghe Sahari Hai<br>
 <br>
Hote Hai Juda Khaire Bashar Khairunnisa Se<br>
Mahboobe Khuda Choot-Te Hai Sher-E-Khuda Se<br>
____________________________<br>
Jiska Kalma Padhte Hai Sab Momine Dee'ndaar<br>
Ab Aazime Firdous Hai Wo Qaasaye Ghaffar<br>
Makke Me Madine Me Tabahi Ke Hai Aasaar<br>
Ab Hote Hai Ummat Se Juda Ahmed-E-Muqtar<br>
 <br>
Faaqe Kiye Ghamgee'n Rahe Dunya Ke Safar Me<br>
Aaqar Safar-E-Marg Kiya Maah-E-Safar Me<br>
____________________________<br>
Ek Kaafera Ne Gosht Me Tha Zaher Khilaya<br>
Us Zaher Ne Aaqar Ye Asar Apna Dikhaya<br>
Moula Ko Sare Bistare Aazaar Giraya<br>
Hisse Me Hassan Ke Wahi Zaher-E Sitam Aaya<br>
 <br>
 Kamzor Kiya Tap Ne Rasoole Arabi Ko<br>
Taaqat Na Rahi Baithne Uthne Ki Nabi Ko<br>
____________________________<br>
Hai Aaqri is Waqt Mera Waaz-O-Nasihat<br>
Ab Mimbar-O-Mehraab Se Hota Hu Mai Ruqsat<br>
Aana Tha Minallah Ilallah Hai Rahlath<br>
Ab Hogi Mulaqat Meri Roz-E-Qayamat<br>
 <br>
Tum Gham Me Mere Nala-O-Faryaad Karoge<br>
Is-Saal Mujhe Hajj Me Bahot Yaad Karoge<br>
____________________________<br>
Do Cheezen Mai Cho-De Huwe Jaata Hu Magar Haa<br>
Wo Ek To Meri Aal Hai Aur ek Hai Quraa'n<br>
Quraan Ki Hafiz Meri Itrath Hai Nigahbaan<br>
Ye Dono Buzurgi Wo Fazilath Me Hai eksaan<br>
 <br>
Quraan To Tum Sab Ki Tilawat Kay Liye Hai<br>
Aur Aal-Payambar Ki Hidayat Ke Liye Hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Gar Baad Mere Pahonchega Zehra Ko Kuch Aazaar<br>
Marqad Se Meri Pusht Nahi Lagne Ki Zinhaar<br>
Ye Chaar Buzurg Aale Payambar Hai Qabardar<br>
Zehra-O- Hussain-O Hassan-O Hyder-E- Karrar<br>
 <br>
Wajib Mere As-Haab Pa Insab Ki Wila Hai<br>
Yaro Yahi Tableeghe Risalat Ka Sila Hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Faaregh Jo Huwa Waaz Se Wo Aashiq-E-Daawar<br>
Phir Ghar Me Gaye Aur Gire Farshe Ajal Par<br>
Us Roz Se Tashreef Na Phir Le Gaye Baahar<br>
Bas Qabr Me Jaane Ko Uthe Va Se Payambar<br>
 <br>
Hairan-O Parishan-O Dil Afsurda Thi Zehra<br>
Baba Abhi Jeeta Tha Magar Murda Thi Zehra<br>
____________________________<br>
Par Ahmed-E Muqtar The Jab Hosh Me Aate<br>
Zehra Ko Basad Yaas Kaleje Se Lagate<br>
Geh Pyar Se Ye Dono Nawasou Ko Sunate<br>
Mai Accha Hu Tum Kisliye Khana Nahi Khate<br>
 <br>
Wo Kehte The Kya Qaak Tamanna e Ghiza Ho<br>
Allah Kare Jald Kahi Tum Ko Shifa Ho<br>
____________________________<br>
Sheh Kehte The Sehat Ho Na Ho Khana To Khalo<br>
Nana Ke Nawaso Dile Muztar Ko Sambhalo<br>
Chillati Thi Zehra Ke Na Ye Zikr Nikalo<br>
Baba Mere Farzandou Ko Dulha To Banalo<br>
 <br>
Arman Tha Tum Ko To Nawasou Ki Dulhan Ka<br>
Kya Byaah Na Dekhoge Hussain Aur Hassan Ka<br>
____________________________<br>
Ek Aah Ki, Rone Lage Aur Ghash Huwe Moula<br>
Darwaze Se Nagaah Sada Ye Huwi Paida<br>
Do Izn Huzoor Aye-Harame Syede Wala<br>
Jakar Kaha Zehra Ne Ke, Behosh Hai Baba<br>
 <br>
Phir Aayi Nida Phir Wahi Farmagayi Zehra<br>
Par Teesri Awaaz Me Tharragayi Zehra<br>
____________________________<br>
Fursat Jo Huwi Ghash Se To Hazrat Ne Bhi Pucha<br>
Zehra Ne Kaha ek Arab Aya Hai Tanha<br>
Wo Maangta Hai Izn Huzoor Aye Mere Baba<br>
Kitna Hi Kiya Uzr Nahi Usko Pazeera<br>
 <br>
Hazrat Ne Kaha Ye Malakul Mout Hai Zehra<br>
Hangam Meri Zeest Ka Ab Fouth Hai Zehra<br>
____________________________<br>
Ye Izn Kisi Se Bhi Nahi Mangta Wallah<br>
Par Haa Mere Darwaze Ke Rutbe Se Hai Aagah<br>
Allah Re Azz-O-Sharafe Syede Zijaah<br>
Be Hukm Na Ghar Me Malakul Mout Ko Thi Raah<br>
 <br>
Par Karbobala Me Yahi Ghar Tha Yahi Dar Tha<br>
Kuffaar Ka Amboh Tha Aatish Ka Guzar Tha...<br>
____________________________